heck?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大臣</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だいじん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">内阁部长；阁僚</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"155193\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>大臣<rp>(</rp><rt>だいじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>自身<rp>(</rp><rt>じしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I spoke to the minister himself.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大統領</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だいとうりょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（国家的）总统；大人物；老大；老兄</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137341\"><ruby>大統領<rp>(</rp><rt>だいとうりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>強硬<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>路線<rp>(</rp><rt>ろせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をとった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The President took a hard line.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">代表</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だいひょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">代表；代表人；代表团；典型；代表性例子；范例；模范；领导人；首领；总机号码；主号码</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113910\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はクラスを<ruby>代表<rp>(</rp><rt>だいひょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>会場<rp>(</rp><rt>かいじょ